  "facts": {
    "name": "Production duration from a planner template row",
    "described_as": "Crew-days to do a quantity of one finishing-trade work item at the planner template's rate: duration = quantity / rate per crew-day. The work item is one template row, named exactly as the row is (see the productivity.* knowledge entries for each row's unit, crew and what it does not cover). The quantity's unit must be the row's unit; a quantity in another unit is refused, naming both. Unverified owner-supplied template: never a project figure.",
